<view class="screen"><view class="heading">我的日历</view><view class="subtitle">打卡与克服外卖冲动，分别留下记号。</view><view class="section"><view class="row month"><button class="soft-button" data-direction="-1" bindtap="change">‹</button><text>{{month}}</text><button class="soft-button" data-direction="1" bindtap="change">›</button></view><view class="error-box" wx:if="{{status === 'error'}}" bindtap="load">日历加载失败 · 重试</view><view class="calendar-grid"><view class="weekday" wx:for="{{weekdays}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view><view wx:for="{{blanks}}" wx:key="*this"></view><view class="day {{item.date === today ? 'today' : ''}} {{selected.date === item.date ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:for="{{days}}" wx:key="date" data-date="{{item.date}}" bindtap="choose"><view>{{item.day}}</view><view class="marks"><text class="check">{{item.checked ? '✓' : ''}}</text><text class="success">{{item.completed ? '●' : ''}}</text></view></view></view><view class="muted stack">✓ 手动打卡　● 当天有成功挑战</view></view><view class="section" wx:if="{{selected}}"><view class="section-title">{{selected.date}}</view><view class="list-item">{{selected.checked ? '已手动打卡' : '未手动打卡'}}</view><view class="list-item">成功挑战 {{selected.completed}} 次</view><view class="list-item">模拟省钱 ¥{{selected.amount}} · {{selected.caloriesKcal}} kcal</view><view class="list-item">当天最后体重：{{selected.weight}}{{selected.grams ? ' kg' : ''}}</view></view><view class="muted">每日打卡在“我的”首页进行，本期不补签。</view></view>

